Package: RMB
Title: Analysis of Drosophila TriKinetics Multi-Beam Activity Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yongjun", "Li", , "yongjunli2017@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Comprehensive tools for analyzing Drosophila (fruit fly) activity 
    and sleep data from TriKinetics Multi-Beam (MB) and Single-Beam (SB) 
    monitoring systems. Features include automated data processing, sleep 
    analysis, position tracking, circadian rhythm analysis, and 
    publication-ready visualizations. Uses an S4 object system similar to 
    Seurat for organized data management.
